  message: "Fixed in PR (dev f92f26691c), Wave-3 Phase-2 §C. Added 'field' to linkers/containment.py CONTAINABLE_KINDS so class-body attributes (kind=field, dotted names) root at their class via Phase-1 dotted-name parent extraction (same path as method). Behavioral evidence (editable binary): fixture class Widget{name,size} — before both field symbols orphaned; after 'Widget contains Widget.name' + 'Widget contains Widget.size' (orphan=False). Self-analysis (re-warmed map /tmp/warm_logon.json): field orphans 1862 -> 0 (99.6% of all 1870 field symbols were orphaned). Production-path test: test_containment_linker.py::test_dot_separated_field. smart-test 5139 passed, containment.py 100% coverage. Dead-code BFS does not traverse contains (per module note), so no dead-code-maybe FP change. Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation for the centrality/reverse-slice shift from ~1862 new class->field contains edges + the orphan-count claim."  # 66c1
